exports[`check.pii.sh (the pre-commit gate) given: [case3] the scanner cannot be found when: [t0] the hook runs against a tree that carries PII then: the output a committer reads matches its snapshot 1`] = `
"── stdout ──

💥 MalfunctionError: the PII scan could not run, so the commit is blocked.

   the scanner was not found at:
     <tmp>
   restore it from git (git checkout -- that path), or reinstall
   the role package, then retry.

   a gate that could not run must never look like a gate that
   passed, so this blocks rather than waves it through.
   to bypass in a genuine emergency: git commit --no-verify. CI
   scans the PR, while the branch is still rewritable.
"
`;

